    "title": "Braya Hodges' Alabama team edged by Texas Tech in June 1 NCAA game - Wiregrass Times",
    "text": "Alabama Crimson Tide, with former Houston Academy softball star Braya Hodges on its roster, fell 5-4 to the Texas Tech Lady Raiders in the NCAA Tournament on Monday, June 1.\nThe contest began at 6 p.m. at Devon Park.\nAlabama’s next tournament game is also set for Monday, June 1, with a start time of 9 p.m. at Devon Park.\nBraya Hodges — Right handed pitcher — Sophomore — 5′8″ — Hometown: Dothan",
